caption:
Ottawa, you’ve gotta check out Taste of Manotick happening on Sept 13 from 2-6PM. It’s an annual street festival celebrating the charms and flavours of the village! You’ll be able to sample food, shop specials and enjoy some entertainment. This year, they have sampling tickets to enhance the experience. Tickets are $3 each or 7 for $20 and can be exchanged for delicious food samples at participating vendors. Join in on the fun! 
-
Check out businesses like:
@garvinbarbecue and try out their southern inspired BBQ
@whitecloversoap for all your handcrafted soap, all natural bath + beauty products, and carefully curated products
@robinleaphoto for your magical photography needs
@lastingimpressiongifts for all your gifting needs
@gitanesburger for a delicious bite! And, possibly a new menu item? 
@lolliesandscoops for a sweet treat, candy or ice cream 
@enchantedchamber1 for your witchy needs 
@6tigersacademy_ for some martial arts
-
Don’t miss out on all the fun! 📍Manotick village, Sept 13 2-6PM
-
Special thank you to @themanotickvillage for coordinating a sneak preview and inviting me to attend ♥️ and thank you to all the lovely businesses who were so generous! 
#manotick #manotickvillage #ottawaevents #ottawasmallbusiness #ottawaeats

Ottawa friends, you need to check out @workshoptrunksale this week/weekend! Shop all Canadian designers at incredible prices! I promise you, you will find something amazing because there are so many beautiful pieces and all the best Autumn pieces. And, you can also shop the vintage market in the same space over the weekend at @nextdoorottawa ♥️ 
-
Some handy tips:
▪️Dress comfortably, leggings + fitted tank for easy try ons
▪️Bring a water bottle + reusable bag
▪️Try on something new, you never know what you will find! 
▪️Add your items to your try ons with the help of staff (free your hands)
📍955A Gladstone St
Friday Sept 26 10 AM - 7PM
Sat Sept 27 11AM - 5PM
Sun Sept 28 11AM - 5PM
-
